# Command Center onboarding

When this workspace opens, when the user asks to customize, set up, brand, or configure the command center, or before substantial feature work on this template:

1. Read `src/config/command-center.config.ts`.
2. If `customized` is `false` or branding still matches the default template, **do not skip to implementation**. Run the **grill-me** interview:
   - One to two focused questions at a time.
   - Use decision trees in root `AGENTS.md`.
   - Execute the full workflow in `.cursor/skills/customize-command-center/SKILL.md`.
3. Present a configuration blueprint and wait for user confirmation before editing config, seed data, or env files.
4. Never commit secrets; use sample data only; confirm before any live deployment change.

If `customized: true`, proceed with the user’s task unless they explicitly ask to re-onboard.